    "storyReveal": "FRAGMENT 08 // THE PREDICTION\n\nThe result appears on screen.\n\nPREDICTION SCORE: 103\nTHREAT LEVEL: HIGH\n\nYou expect to find a security incident attached to the record.\n\nInstead, you find something else.\n\nSUBJECT: SUBJECT 0\nTHREAT: HIGH\nMODEL CONFIDENCE: 97.4%\nCRIME DETECTED: NONE\n\nYou read the last line again.\n\nNONE.\n\nZERO had not breached the Grid.\n\nHe had not stolen anything.\n\nHe had not attacked anyone.\n\nHe had done nothing that justified a threat classification.\n\nThe Grid had simply predicted that he would become dangerous.\n\nAnd it made that prediction years before ZERO disappeared.\n\nThe prediction wasn't based on something he had done.\n\nIt was based on what the Grid believed he would do.\n\nYou look at the record again.\n\nPREDICTED BEHAVIOR.\n\nNot actual behavior.\n\nA prediction.\n\nA thought occurs to you:\n\nWhat happened to people after the Grid predicted something about them?\n\nYou search the project files.\n\nThe next surviving fragment contains part of the decision system.\n\nYou open it.",
