    "storyText": "The Grid has begun recording your investigation.\n\nAmong thousands of routine events, one hidden transmission has been embedded.\n\nA character is part of the transmission only when:\n- the event was performed by a privileged account (privilege >= 7),\n- the action was WATCH or TRACE,\n- and the surveillance counter is currently odd.\n\nTrace the events in order and reconstruct the hidden message.",
    "storyReveal": "FRAGMENT 11 // THE PURSUIT\n\nThe reconstructed message appears:\n\nSTOP LOOKING\n\nNo sender.\n\nNo account name.\n\nNo timestamp.\n\nYou check ZERO's previous transmissions.\n\nThe message doesn't match his signature.\n\nYou search the event source.\n\nGRID CONTROL CHANNEL\n\nSomeone has been watching your investigation.\n\nNot occasionally.\n\nContinuously.\n\nEvery fragment you recover.\n\nEvery archive you open.\n\nEvery question you answer.\n\nSomeone knows exactly how far you've come.\n\nThen another event appears:\n\nSURVEILLANCE TARGET: ACTIVE\n\nTARGET: YOU\n\nYou are no longer following the investigation.\n\nThe investigation is following you.",
